    <description>A ceremonial weapon gifted by the Gray Wind, exquisite and unique.\nWhen she came to understand what 'malice' meant, she also discovered that some power was dividing these converging thoughts.\nThe means of dealing with this malice were ingenious and flexible... They could be explained as the result of cooperation between multiple bureaucratic agencies, yet their efficiency and effect far exceeded ordinary cooperative projects—as if this task had the highest priority.\nWhat remained were information sources that could not be traced, communications that could not be tracked, and permits that could not be explained.</description>
