    <description>A ceremonial weapon gifted by the Gray Wind, exquisite and unique.\nUnlike the energy weapons the Gray usually employ, this is a customized kinetic weapon.\nBecause their thought components differ, individuals without a direct link can still produce thoughts both alike and unalike; sometimes she cannot understand what they are trying to express at all, and can only ask other individuals afterward.\nShe only knew they needed parts of her for different tasks and experiments.\nHer copies were assigned as target drones for weapon tests, lead ships in space battles, hostile targets for officer combat training, and experimental material in laboratories.\nShe completed them—and completed them very well.</description>
