    <description>A ceremonial weapon gifted by the Gray Wind, exquisite and unique.\nUnlike the energy weapons the Gray usually employ, this is a customized kinetic weapon.\nAs the drums of war faded, the War Council brought sealed proposals back to the agenda, and the science department 'accidentally' discovered an ancient megastructure in a frontier system. Studying it required an individual who could work with scarce supplies and endure extreme environments.\nThere was no doubt she was the best choice. The Gray Wind worked there for three standard years. When she returned, artificial intelligence had been granted full citizenship.\n\n'Thank you.'\nOn her identification papers, elegant handwriting spelled this out—like a mark formed from her memories, or a reminder she gave herself of a conception of a being she could never reach.</description>
