    <description>A ceremonial weapon gifted by the Gray Wind, exquisite and unique.\nUnlike the energy weapons the Gray usually employ, this is a customized kinetic weapon.\nEven now, she still cannot fully blend into the human world, but she has taken a seat on the War Council.\nSome naval officers still discuss her in private. Researchers have gradually come to regard her contributions as ordinary.\nChildren are still taught by their parents to be wary of 'non-human intelligence.'\nThe world today is the same as yesterday's—and yet utterly different.\nThe War Council's records contain words of praise for her; soldiers who fought beside her regard her as a comrade; captains and crews who survived under her cover publicly salute her.\nAbove the sky, in a dedicated drydock, the Gray Wind bears countless marks. In children's drawings, the Gray Wind is a giant warship protecting their planet.\nAt the same time, she knows—'you' are right here, casting your gaze through countless days and nights, accompanying her through countless years.\nShe no longer longs to become human. Where the heart is at peace, the wind, too, comes home.</description>
